[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_00_0010","text":"配这件衣服的饰品……\n是这个吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_00_0020","text":"嗯……！\n甜花……觉得那个……最好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_00_0030","text":"──啊……\n不过……这个……也喜欢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_00_0040","text":"选哪个好～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_00_0005","text":"粉色的\n比较好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_00_0006","text":"红色吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_00_0007","text":"我喜欢蓝色的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_01_0010","text":"嘿嘿……制作人和\n甜花选的……一样……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_01_0020","text":"两个人的推荐肯定没错……！\n就选这个了☆"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_02_0010","text":"以点缀的感觉\n选红色试试看怎么样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_02_0020","text":"你也这么觉得？\n……是啊！　作为点缀可能正好！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_03_0010","text":"哇……！\n这时候出现了第三个选项……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04010000_03_0020","text":"……制作人\n喜欢这种的啊……原来如此……"}]
